' death > deploy. Rules do not await ""onAnimationEnd"".
title OUTDATED — crush already stacks deploy+death;\ndo not replan exclusive clips

component "timelinePlayer\ncrush cues" as TL <<async>>
component "DeployAnimation" as DEP <<app>>
component "DeathAnimation" as DIE <<app>>
component "deriveVisualFrame\ndeath > deploy" as VF <<app>>
component "**one clip wins**" as DROP <<error>>

TL ARROW_MAIN DEP
TL ARROW_MAIN DIE
DEP ARROW_MAIN VF
DIE ARROW_MAIN VF
DROP ARROW_ERROR VF : shipped anti-goal

