  failing VFX fixture, not this
  compositing plan.** See
  ""vfx-guarantees.md"".
end note

legend bottom
  **Do not implement this file.**
  ==
  Open ""composite-vfx-stack.puml"".
  Keep the engine off the clip clock.
end legend
@enduml
